#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1337
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You walked %d steps today. Try to take even more steps tomorrow–show us what "
"you're made of!"
msgstr ""
"Du gick %d steg idag. Försök gå ännu fler steg imorgon, visa vad du är "
"kapabel till!"

#. / Sleep notification on wake up, slept above their typical sleep duration
#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1389
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Refreshed? You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% above your typical. Go tackle "
"your day 😃."
msgstr ""
"Utvilad? Du sov i %dt %dm, vilket är %d%% mer än du brukar. Dags att fånga "
"dagen 😃."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1391
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You caught some killer zzz’s! You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% above your "
"typical. Keep it up."
msgstr ""
"Du sov som en stock! Du sov i %dt %dm, vilket är %d%% mer än du brukar. "
"Fortsätt så."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1393
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Rise and shine! You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% above your typical. Do "
"it again tonight, sleep master."
msgstr ""
"Upp och hoppa! Du slov i %dt %dm, vilket är %d%% mer än du brukar. Upprepa "
"det inatt, din sjusovare."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1396
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Mmmm...what a night. You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% above your typical. "
"That's gotta feel good!"
msgstr ""
"Mmm... vilken natt. Du sov i %dt %dm, vilket är %d%% mer än du brukar. Det "
"måste kännas skönt!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1399
#, c-format
msgid ""
"That's a lot of sheep you just counted! You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% "
"above your typical. Boom shakalaka."
msgstr ""
"Det var många får du räknade! Du sov i %dt %dm vilket är %d%% mer än du "
"brukar. Snitsigt!"

#. / Sleep notification on wake up, slept similar to their typical sleep duration
#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1409
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Good mornin’. You slept for %dH %dM. Every good day begins with a solid "
"night’s sleep...kinda like that one 😉 Keep it up!"
msgstr ""
"Go'morron! Du sov i %dt %dm. En bra dag börjar med en god natts sömn... Den "
"här natten är ett bra exempel på det 😉. Fortsätt så!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1412
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Good morning! You slept for %dH %dM. Consistency is key; keep doing what "
"you're doing 😃."
msgstr ""
"God morgon! Du sov i %dt %dm. Regelbundenhet är nyckeln till att lyckas, "
"fortsätt så 😃."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1415
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You're rockin' the shut eye! You slept for %dH %dM. Make it a nightly "
"ritual. You deserve it."
msgstr ""
"Vilken sömntuta! Du sov i %dt %dm. Gör det till din nya rutin, du förtjänar "
"att sova gott."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1417
#, c-format
msgid "Feelin' good? You slept for %dH %dM. Nothing can stop you now 👊"
msgstr "Känner du dig pigg? Du sov i %dt %dm. Inget kan stopp dig nu 👊"

#. / Sleep notification on wake up, slept below their typical sleep duration
#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1426
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Hey sleepy head. You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. Try "
"to get more tonight!"
msgstr ""
"Hej trötter. Du sov i %dt %dm, vilket är %d%% mindre än du brukar. Försök "
"sova lite mer inatt."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1428
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Groggy? You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. Sleep is "
"important for everything you do-try getting more shut eye tonight!"
msgstr ""
"Groggy? Du sov i %dt %dm vilket är %d%% mindre än du brukar. Sömn är viktigt "
"för kropp och själ, försök få lite mer sömn inatt!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1430
#, c-format
msgid ""
"It's a new day! You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. It's "
"not your best, but there's always tonight."
msgstr ""
"En ny dag! Du sov i %dt %dm vilket är %d%% mindre än du brukar. Det kunde "
"varit bättre, men du har en ny chans inatt!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1433
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Goooood morning! You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. Go "
"crush your day and then get back in bed 😉"
msgstr ""
"Goooood morgon! Du sov i %dt %dm vilket är %d%% mindre än du brukar. Ta och "
"äg den här dagen, sen kryper du i säng 😉"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1440
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. Sleep is vital for "
"all your great ideas–how 'bout getting more tonight?"
msgstr ""
"Du sov i %dt %dm vilket är %d%% mindre än du brukar. Sömn är nödvändig för "
"kreativiteten, försök klämma in lite mer sömn inatt."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1442
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You only slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. We know you're "
"busy, but try getting more tonight. We believe in you 😉"
msgstr ""
"Du sov endas %dt %dm vilket är %d%% mindre än du brukar. Vi förstår att du "
"kan ha mycket att stå i, men försök sova lite mer inatt, du fixar det 😉"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1444
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. We know stuff "
"happens; take another crack at it tonight."
msgstr ""
"Du sov i %dt %dm vilket är %d%% mindre än du brukar. Vi förstår att livet "
"kan komma ivägen, gör ett nytt försök inatt."

